  triage:title "Reserved atm-daemon member-name rejection on add-member and update-member has zero test coverage (re-assessment of AX6-QA1-003)" ;
  triage:description "AX.6 QA-2 (quality-mgr QA-AX6-R2-1788630712, PR #1204 report 2026-09-05T19:01Z, req-qa) at head c3268df8a3dfa5c84f4465459c5d2ba86df1c857. Re-assessment of AX6-QA1-003: the reserved-name (atm-daemon) rejection in crates/atm-core/src/team_admin/member_mutation.rs (helper at line 417, add/update paths at 774-830) is implemented correctly but no test exercises either path; the only test in the file's mod tests block is unrelated. Fix: add tests for add-member and update-member rejection asserting the error code and that the roster is unchanged." ;
